I look at the laptop screen.
A new person comes on the screen.
"Father, mother, who is with you?" I ask.
It is my elder brother, Diego.
Diego smiles at the camera.
He has a dog in his hands.
It is our dog, Lola.
I feel very happy.
"Lola!"
"My Lola!" I call out loudly.
Lola looks at the screen.
Her ears stand up.
"Maya, are you fine?" Diego asks.
"I am fine, Diego chetta," I answer.
Lola suddenly barks happily.
She knows my voice.
I look into her eyes.
My morning is very beautiful now.
